+
+Paper: Jakob Keller, Christian Rieck, Christian Scheffer, and Arne Schmidt,
+[*Particle-Based Assembly Using Precise Global Control*](https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.05784),
+arXiv:2105.05784 (version 3).
