+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 5.1's tree-shape algorithm decides constructibility "
+        "and obtains an order in O(n), followed here by O(nr+tr) exact tag "
+        "processing; at the hard preset (n=540,r=12,t=120) the implemented "
